1
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:03,820
各位 我快搞定座位安排了
Guys, I am nailing my seating chart.

2
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:06,880
能别把我排在卢克旁边吗
Can you not put me near Luke?

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:07,860
我受不了他嚼东西的声音
I can't with the chewing.

4
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:09,400
你就是个被宠坏的城市小孩
You are a spoiled city kid.

5
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:11,780
我小时候直到11岁才能跟人类坐一桌
I was 11 before I got to sit at the people table.

6
00:00:12,149 --> 00:00:14,433
小卡 我都问你十次了
Cam. Cam, I've asked you 10 times.

7
00:00:14,433 --> 00:00:16,000
你怎么还没给我发
Why haven't you sent me our itinerary

8
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,060
去你父母家的行程安排
for your trip to your parents' house?

9
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:18,020
最近有点忙
Been a little busy.

10
00:00:20,193 --> 00:00:22,880
内容是你 我还有莉莉上圣诞老人的电臀舞课
of you, me, and Lily dancing in Santa's Twerkshop.

11
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:23,900
瞧瞧我们的屁股啊
Look at our butts.

12
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:25,140
圣诞快乐
Merry Christmas!

13
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:26,880
-圣诞快乐啊 -大家好啊
- Merry Christmas. - Hello.

14
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:28,483
谁给我拿杯酒啊
So, who's going to get me a drink?

15
00:00:28,483 --> 00:00:29,420
老娘不用再喂母乳了
Mama's done breast-feeding.

16
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:31,050
这对"奶宝"又属于我自己了
These babies are all mine again,

17
00:00:31,050 --> 00:00:32,425
我准备把它们里面灌满酒
and I'm ready to fill 'em up with wine.

18
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:34,320
人体构造的原理不是这样的
Well, not how the human body works,

19
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:35,800
但我很为你开心
but I'm very happy for you.

20
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:38,380
-我怀念过去的海莉 -我也是
- I've missed Old Haley! - Me too.

21
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:41,120
话说 你能把我和宝宝跟海莉隔得远一点吗
Oh, hey, can you move Haley away from me and the twins?

22
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:43,475
我送她的礼物就是让她今晚摆脱当妈的职责 所以...
My present to her is the night off from Mommy duties, so...

23
00:00:43,475 --> 00:00:46,000
好吧 我真希望你能早点跟我说
Okay, well, I would've appreciated a little heads-up,

24
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,820
但这是份贴心的礼物 所以...
but it's a thoughtful gift, so...

25
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:49,300
也是免费的 这是大好事
It's also free, which is helpful

26
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:51,400
因为我夏天时忘记银行卡密码了
because I forgot my ATM pin last summer.

27
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:54,160
我有没有对你提过我最爱的四个数字
Any chance I ever mentioned my four favorite numbers to you?

28
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:54,700
没有
No.

29
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,620
别 千万别把我和歌洛莉亚排在一起
Oh, no. Please move me away from Gloria.

30
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:57,380
会很尴尬的
It'll be weird.

31
00:00:57,380 --> 00:00:59,420
歌洛莉亚最近在我爸手下工作
Gloria's been working for my dad.

32
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:02,400
他那么悉心地指导她 但是那天
He totally mentored her, and then the other day,

33
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:04,600
我却抓到她去我爸的竞争对手那里面试
I caught her interviewing with his competitors.

34
00:01:05,100 --> 00:01:06,480
话说 如果我真加入你们
So, if I come on board,

35
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:08,520
我需要把发型改成跟你们一样的吗
do I have to change my hairstyle?

36
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:12,740
-可以商量这事 -这算是我们的特色风格
- We'll talk about it. - It's kind of our thing.

37
00:01:15,740 --> 00:01:17,009
给你这个聪明人提个醒
Word to the wise --

38
00:01:17,009 --> 00:01:20,009
我就像是马修·麦康纳最近的五部电影
I'm like the last five Matthew McConaughey movies.

39
00:01:20,360 --> 00:01:21,720
你从没看过我
You never saw me.

40
00:01:24,240 --> 00:01:24,800
好吧
Fine.

41
00:01:25,780 --> 00:01:26,780
圣诞快乐
Merry Christmas!

42
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:27,740
你们好啊
Hello.

43
00:01:29,140 --> 00:01:31,900
圣诞餐桌就该这样才对嘛
Now, this is what a Christmas table should look like.

44
00:01:32,140 --> 00:01:32,780
无意冒犯 亲爱的
No offense, honey.

45
00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:34,740
我也喜欢你搞的"谁他妈在乎"风格的圣诞餐桌
I also love your whole "who cares" approach.

46
00:01:37,320 --> 00:01:37,540
小卡
Cam?

47
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:39,220
我不能坐在爸爸旁边
I can't sit next to Dad.

48
00:01:39,380 --> 00:01:41,820
我觉得他会叫我去他傻兮兮的狗窝公司工作
I think he's gonna ask me to work for his stupid dog bed company.

49
00:01:42,340 --> 00:01:42,700
克莱尔
Claire!

50
00:01:43,340 --> 00:01:43,840
怎么了
What?!

51
00:01:44,180 --> 00:01:46,280
我不能在圣诞节让他心碎啊
I can't break his heart on Christmas.

52
00:01:46,360 --> 00:01:49,120
你也知道节日会让他有爱又脆弱
You know how the holiday makes him so sweet and vulnerable.

53
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:50,839
我讨厌这傻逼围巾
I hate this damn scarf!

54
00:01:50,839 --> 00:01:52,801
我看着跟女演员安杰丽卡·休斯顿一样
I look like Anjelica Huston!

55
00:01:52,801 --> 00:01:54,515
是小卡买的 你给我戴着
Cam bought it! You wear it!

56
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:58,220
好爱这围巾哦 我感觉自己像个电影明星
Love the scarf! I feel like a movie star!

57
00:01:58,760 --> 00:02:00,720
小卡 把我安排在克莱尔旁边好吗
Cam, put me next to Claire, okay?

58
00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:01,960
我有事要跟她谈
I want to talk to her about something.

59
00:02:02,420 --> 00:02:03,400
你终于来了
There she is!

60
00:02:03,660 --> 00:02:05,060
我迫不及待要把礼物送给你了
I can't wait to give you your gift.

61
00:02:05,100 --> 00:02:06,780
要现在打开吗 现在打开吧
Should we open it now? Let's open it now.

62
00:02:06,820 --> 00:02:08,240
天啊 天啊
Oh, my God! Oh, my God!

63
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:09,760
天啊 天啊
Oh, my God! Oh, my God!

64
00:02:10,980 --> 00:02:11,820
你看懂了吗
You get it?

65
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:13,760
2020的远见
2020 vision.

66
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:15,498
是个双关啊
It works two ways.

67
00:02:15,498 --> 00:02:17,340
你会出现在超多公交站长椅上
You are gonna be on so many bus benches.

68
00:02:17,340 --> 00:02:19,260
但不是像以前你没嫁给杰时
And in a different way than when you had to go somewhere

69
00:02:19,260 --> 00:02:20,320
出门都要等公交那种方式
before you married Jay.

70
00:02:20,320 --> 00:02:23,520
天啊 爸 你对你的员工可真宠爱
Wow. Dad, that is a lovely gesture.

71
00:02:23,700 --> 00:02:24,660
谢谢你 艾丽克斯
Thank you, Alex.

72
00:02:24,860 --> 00:02:27,394
你总是知道什么该说 什么不该说
You always know what to say and what not to say.

73
00:02:27,394 --> 00:02:29,220
菲尔 你太赞了
Phil, you're amazing.

74
00:02:29,220 --> 00:02:31,140
我觉得这挺讽刺的
Which is ironic, I think,

75
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:34,260
因为你儿子可能是个反社会者
because your son might be a sociopath.

76
00:02:34,312 --> 00:02:36,660
等等 这是怎么回事
Wait. W-What's all this, then?

77
00:02:36,660 --> 00:02:38,000
你何不问问他呢
Why don't you ask him?

78
00:02:38,780 --> 00:02:39,740
卢克 发生什么事了
Luke, what happened?

79
00:02:39,740 --> 00:02:41,960
我来告诉你们发生了什么
I will tell you what happened.

80
00:02:42,420 --> 00:02:45,300
他不但没有帮曼尼追回雪莉
Instead of helping Manny get Sherry back,

81
00:02:45,540 --> 00:02:47,960
还将她抢为己有
he stole her for himself!

82
00:02:49,180 --> 00:02:51,319
是真的 雪莉和我是一对了
It's true. Sherry and I are a thing.

83
00:02:51,319 --> 00:02:53,176
-什么 -天啊 哇
- What?! -Oh, my God. Wow.

84
00:02:53,176 --> 00:02:55,206
小卡 把曼尼划掉
Cam, take Manny off.

85
00:02:55,260 --> 00:02:56,140
他不来了
He's not coming.

86
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:58,480
好了 大家随便坐吧
Okay, fine. Everybody just sit wherever they want,

87
00:02:58,480 --> 00:03:00,820
就跟一帮流浪汉围着篝火乱坐一样
like a bunch of hobos around a barrel fire.

88
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:16,657
卢克 你怎么能做出这种事
Luke, how could you do this?

89
00:03:16,657 --> 00:03:18,240
而且还是对曼尼下黑手
And to Manny, of all people?

90
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:21,540
我很内疚 但我跟雪莉的火花...
I feel bad, but this thing with Sherry is...

91
00:03:21,540 --> 00:03:22,400
很特别
special.

92
00:03:23,140 --> 00:03:24,777
这不是我平时的胡乱勾搭那种
This isn't my usual hit it and quit it.

93
00:03:24,777 --> 00:03:26,660
-真"有魅力" -这话真刺耳
- Charming. - That's rough on the ears.

94
00:03:26,660 --> 00:03:28,460
再说 雪莉根本不想跟曼尼在一起
Plus, Sherry doesn't want to be with Manny,

95
00:03:28,500 --> 00:03:30,400
我们真的很来电
and we really connect.

96
00:03:31,014 --> 00:03:31,720
我...
Well, I --

97
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:34,560
我觉得如果你真的那么在乎她...
I guess if you really care about her that much --

98
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:35,080
我是的
I do.

99
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:36,860
她聪明又很酷
She's smart and cool,

100
00:03:36,860 --> 00:03:38,400
而且 她总是能逗我开心
and, man, does she make me laugh.

101
00:03:38,820 --> 00:03:39,560
我懂
I get it.

102
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:41,300
没有比幽默的女人更性感的了
Nothing sexier than a funny woman.

103
00:03:41,460 --> 00:03:42,880
或是井井有条的女人
Or an organized one.

104
00:03:44,040 --> 00:03:46,120
你和小卡之间是怎么回事
So, what's up with you and Cam?

105
00:03:46,420 --> 00:03:47,220
我察觉到紧张的氛围
I'm sensing tension.

106
00:03:47,440 --> 00:03:48,700
我才没察觉到什么紧张的氛围
I didn't sense any tension.

107
00:03:48,940 --> 00:03:50,260
我只是想听一些狗血八卦
I was just looking for some drama

108
00:03:50,260 --> 00:03:51,440
我想着基佬门前多八卦是必然的
and figured it was a safe bet.

109
00:03:51,780 --> 00:03:53,280
的确有点紧张的氛围
There is tension!

110
00:03:53,500 --> 00:03:55,200
听着 首先
Okay, so, first of all,

111
00:03:55,260 --> 00:03:57,780
他对于这顿晚餐有点过分关注
he's being extra crazy about this dinner.

112
00:03:58,140 --> 00:03:59,160
但是你再听听这个
But now get this --

113
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:01,000
每年圣诞节 我都会抱怨
every Christmas, I complain about

114
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:02,900
要跟他一起回他老家 见他的家人
having to go home with him to -- to see his family,

115
00:04:02,900 --> 00:04:05,580
但是今年 他说我不想去可以不用去
and this year, he said I don't have to go.

116
00:04:05,580 --> 00:04:07,320
他对此完全没意见
And he was totally cool about it.

117
00:04:07,480 --> 00:04:08,740
不妙 超级可疑
Oh, no. Super fishy.

118
00:04:09,460 --> 00:04:11,318
所以你翻他的行李没有找到任何线索吗
So, you didn't find any clues when you went through his luggage?

119
00:04:11,318 --> 00:04:13,457
我 没翻他的行李啊
I...didn't go through his luggage.

120
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:15,440
你简直像是希望你的婚姻破裂一样
It's like you want your marriage to fall apart.

121
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:15,980
跟我来
Come on.

122
00:04:18,840 --> 00:04:20,620
我们要怎么解决卢克和曼尼之间的矛盾
What are we gonna do about Luke and Manny?

123
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:21,440
什么都不做
Nothing.

124
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:24,040
我最怕的就是争端升级 跟歌洛莉亚开启大战
The last thing I want is to get into a whole thing with Gloria.

125
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:25,140
亲爱的 有空吗
Hey, hon, got a minute?

126
00:04:25,580 --> 00:04:26,440
最怕的是这个
Second to last.

127
00:04:26,500 --> 00:04:28,540
抱歉 爸 我要去跟歌洛莉亚开启世界大战了
Sorry, Dad! I gotta get into a whole thing with Gloria.

128
00:04:28,540 --> 00:04:30,160
没人可以开启任何大战
Or nobody gets into anything with anybody

129
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:31,660
我们要过个圆满的圣诞节
and we have a storybook Christmas.

130
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:32,680
要吃个迷你芝士球吗
How about a mini cheeseball?

131
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,980
卢克会跟雪莉分手吗
Is Luke going to break up with Sherry?

132
00:04:35,380 --> 00:04:38,200
歌洛莉亚 我很抱歉曼尼这么伤心难过
Gloria, I am sorry that Manny is so upset,

133
00:04:38,280 --> 00:04:40,120
但卢克的感情是真挚的
but Luke's feelings are sincere.

134
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:41,840
他已经非常自责了
He's already beating himself up.

135
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,780
求你了 别生他的气
Please, don't be mad at him.

136
00:04:44,280 --> 00:04:45,860
你说得对 我不应该生卢克的气
You're right. I shouldn't be mad at Luke.

137
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:47,380
又不是他把自己养大的
He didn't raise himself.

138
00:04:48,860 --> 00:04:49,720
重新说一次
One more time?

139
00:04:50,060 --> 00:04:52,600
根据你过去的故事
Based on the stories from your past,

140
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:56,800
你很少会放弃享受肉体的快感
you've rarely denied yourself the pleasures of the flesh.

141
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:57,677
好了 暂...
Okay! Time --

142
00:04:57,677 --> 00:04:59,567
-暂停 双方队伍请暂停 -小卡 小卡
- Time out! Time out! - Cam? Cam!

143
00:04:59,567 --> 00:05:02,180
你怎么会有一张去密苏里州的头等舱机票
Why do you have a first-class ticket to Missouri?

144
00:05:02,180 --> 00:05:04,600
先别问这个 你为什么翻我的行李箱
Okay, not now. And why are you digging through my suitcase?

145
00:05:05,300 --> 00:05:05,894
老爸
Hey, Dad?

146
00:05:05,894 --> 00:05:07,280
你就任由你老婆
Are you just gonna stand there

147
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:08,620
叫我荡妇吗
while your wife calls me a tramp?

148
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:10,820
我感觉现在加入讨论风险很大
I feel this is a risky time to weigh in.

149
00:05:11,060 --> 00:05:12,400
同意 不要再吵了
Agreed. No more fighting.

150
00:05:12,460 --> 00:05:14,769
我们都来享用芝士球吧
Let's just all enjoy a cheeseball!

151
00:05:14,769 --> 00:05:17,020
这是我奶奶有百年历史的食谱
It's my grandma's 100-year-old recipe,

152
00:05:17,020 --> 00:05:19,220
只是我用辣椒取代了可卡因
except I use cayenne pepper instead of cocaine.

153
00:05:19,400 --> 00:05:20,280
不好意思 歌洛莉亚
I'm sorry, Gloria.

154
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:22,240
我不准任何人说我老婆放荡
No one calls my wife loose.

155
00:05:22,300 --> 00:05:23,720
在她风华正茂时 是否享受过
In her day, did she enjoy

156
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:25,100
一些男人的陪伴 当然
the company of a few men? Sure.

157
00:05:25,100 --> 00:05:26,158
是不是我们每次出门
Is it hard to leave the house

158
00:05:26,158 --> 00:05:28,020
十有八九会撞见她的前任
without running into one of her ex-lovers?

159
00:05:28,020 --> 00:05:29,335
看我们在哪个城市了
Depends on what city we're in.

160
00:05:29,335 --> 00:05:30,400
你排比完了吗
Do you have an end to this?

161
00:05:30,400 --> 00:05:31,980
她的身体她作主
Her body, her choices,

162
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:34,150
在这美丽星球上到处留情又如何
all over this beautiful planet!

163
00:05:34,150 --> 00:05:36,440
-能不能说回头等舱机票的事 -是啊
- Can we get back to the first-class ticket thing? - Yeah. Yeah.

164
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:37,340
你想隐瞒什么呢
What are we hiding?

165
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:38,820
我不知道这事跟你有毛线关系
Okay, I'm not sure what you have to do with this,

166
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:40,520
但机票是我爸妈买给我的
but my parents bought me that ticket.

167
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:41,480
你爸妈
Your parents?

168
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:42,921
他们可是觉得放颗薄荷糖
The people whose idea of fancy

169
00:05:42,921 --> 00:05:45,105
进杜松子酒里就够高档的土老帽
is dropping a Certs into a jar of schnapps?

170
00:05:45,105 --> 00:05:47,260
我告诉你 奶奶的薄荷糖火箭
I'll have you know that Grandma's Mint Rockets

171
00:05:47,260 --> 00:05:49,700
在州长官邸里可是广受欢迎呢
are the cocktail of choice at the governor's mansion.

172
00:05:49,960 --> 00:05:51,080
你太娇生惯养曼尼了
You coddle Manny.

173
00:05:51,180 --> 00:05:52,940
他早该放下雪莉了
He should already be over Sherry.

174
00:05:52,940 --> 00:05:55,370
但我想让男孩子和妈同睡到15岁
But I guess that's what happens when you let a kid

175
00:05:55,370 --> 00:05:57,575
就会有这种结果
sleep in your bed till he's...15.

176
00:05:58,480 --> 00:06:00,027
我们为什么要讨论曼尼呢
Why are we talking about Manny, anyway,

177
00:06:00,027 --> 00:06:02,066
这明摆着是菲尔的错啊
when this is clearly Phil's fault?

178
00:06:02,066 --> 00:06:02,620
-什么 -什么
- What? - What?!

179
00:06:02,620 --> 00:06:03,479
你显然没有
Well, I mean, you obviously

180
00:06:03,479 --> 00:06:05,820
教卢克绅士守则
didn't teach Luke about the gentlemen's code.

181
00:06:05,820 --> 00:06:06,958
我当然教了
I did so!

182
00:06:06,958 --> 00:06:08,540
永远不要让别人的击掌尴尬停在半空
Never leave a high-five hanging,

183
00:06:08,540 --> 00:06:10,798
如果你拍对方的背 那拥抱多紧都没问题
no hug is too tight if you slap the guy's back --

184
00:06:10,798 --> 00:06:13,040
应该是朋友妻不可戏
It's never steal a broad from a friend,

185
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,260
绝对别让他留胡子
never let him grow a mustache

186
00:06:14,260 --> 00:06:15,620
除非他的职业是有权威的应急人员
unless they're a first responder.

187
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:18,740
老爸 风大你也不怕闪了舌头
Okay. That is some high horse you're on there, Dad.

188
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:21,440
竟敢指责菲尔是失职的父亲
Accusing Phil of dropping the parenting ball?

189
00:06:21,440 --> 00:06:22,180
开撕了
Here we go.

190
00:06:22,180 --> 00:06:24,320
说出两个我小时候的朋友
Name two of my friends growing up.

191
00:06:24,380 --> 00:06:26,460
刻薄的那个和体重超标那个
The mean one and the heavy one.

192
00:06:26,826 --> 00:06:28,960
提醒一下各位 曼尼来了
Hey, just a heads-up -- Manny's here.

193
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:29,420
什么
What?

194
00:06:29,840 --> 00:06:32,218
那表明他有多么勇敢
That shows how brave he is.

195
00:06:32,218 --> 00:06:34,260
不过我们聊点别的话题吧
Eh, but let's talk about something else.

196
00:06:34,260 --> 00:06:38,020
他最不希望的就是我们小题大做
The last thing he wants is to make all this a big deal.

197
00:06:40,860 --> 00:06:42,060
大家好
Hello, all.

198
00:06:43,380 --> 00:06:45,040
原谅我穿了阴沉忧丧气的袍子
Forgive my somber drapings,

199
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:47,140
但就像契诃夫《海鸥》里的玛莎一样
but like Masha in Chekhov's "The Seagull,"

200
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:49,280
我正在哀悼我的人生
I am in mourning for my life.

201
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:52,200
别担心 我不想惹事
And don't worry. I don't want any trouble.

202
00:06:52,440 --> 00:06:54,700
今天我不是主角 家人团聚才是重点
Today is not about me. It's about family.

203
00:06:55,140 --> 00:06:56,080
我们一家人
Our family.

204
00:06:56,220 --> 00:06:58,060
还有我们分享的深刻深厚的爱
And the deep, profound love we share.

205
00:06:58,340 --> 00:06:59,480
老天 这番话俗到爆
Man, that's cheesy.

206
00:06:59,740 --> 00:07:01,220
或许吧 但这是我的真实感受
Maybe, but it's how I feel.

207
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:05,000
谢谢你曼尼 提醒了我们所有人什么最重要
Thank you, Manny, for reminding us all what's important

208
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:08,320
以及今年应该是我们最难忘的圣诞节
and how this should be the most memorable Christmas.

209
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:10,740
曼尼 你想喝香槟鸡尾酒吗
Manny, would you care for a champagne cocktail?

210
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:13,140
有劳了 我的确很喜欢香槟
Please. I do love champagne.

211
00:07:13,580 --> 00:07:15,320
也许等我转过身去时
And maybe when I turn my back,

212
00:07:15,340 --> 00:07:16,900
卢克可以把舌头伸入杯子里
Luke can put his tongue all over it.

213
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:23,160
全都好痛啊
Everything hurts!

214
00:07:25,980 --> 00:07:27,620
卢克 我想你该走了
Luke, I think you should go.

215
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:29,860
不 他哪都不会去
No. He is not going anywhere.

216
00:07:30,380 --> 00:07:33,640
每家都有一个坏胚子 需要被赶出去
Every family has a bad seed that needs to be cast out

217
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:35,880
这样他们才能浪子回头
so that they can find their way back.

218
00:07:36,100 --> 00:07:38,380
我本来以为我们家的坏胚子会是海莉
I thought that ours was going to be Haley,

219
00:07:38,580 --> 00:07:40,460
但意外怀孕
but an accidental pregnancy

220
00:07:40,460 --> 00:07:42,979
拯救了她 没有走上堕落的人生
saved her from a life of degradation.

221
00:07:42,979 --> 00:07:44,060
干嘛夸人家
Aww!

222
00:07:44,409 --> 00:07:45,900
谁都不用离开
W-- Nobody has to leave.

223
00:07:45,900 --> 00:07:48,440
我能和我爱的人们共度一个夜晚
I can spend one evening with the people I love

224
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:49,460
我也能忍受
and a shifty lecher

225
00:07:49,460 --> 00:07:51,300
多一个戴着涂满蛋黄酱的浴帽睡觉的奸诈淫棍
who sleeps in a shower cap filled with mayonnaise.

226
00:07:51,420 --> 00:07:52,778
那能让我的头发光泽靓丽
It gives me my sheen.

227
00:07:52,778 --> 00:07:54,620
而且我让你别说出去了 你个怨夫
And I told you that in confidence, you hump!

228
00:07:54,620 --> 00:07:56,040
好了 都给我闭嘴
Okay! Knock it off!

229
00:07:56,080 --> 00:07:57,900
该用农场的裁决方式来解决了
It is time for some farm justice.

230
00:07:58,420 --> 00:08:00,100
在我老家 如果同时有两头公牛想当老大
Back home, when we have two alpha bulls,

231
00:08:00,140 --> 00:08:02,900
我们就把它们关进围栏里 决斗定胜负
we lock 'em in a pen and let them fight it out.

232
00:08:03,220 --> 00:08:05,493
这是曼尼和卢克之间要解决的问题
This is between Manny and Luke.

233
00:08:05,493 --> 00:08:07,080
快 走啊 哞 走啊
Come on! Let's go. Hyah! Hyah!

234
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:10,080
你们自便享用姜饼人哦
Oh, and help yourself to a gingerbread person.

235
00:08:10,180 --> 00:08:12,039
都是无麸质无性别的
They're both gluten and gender free.

236
00:08:12,039 --> 00:08:13,228
好贴心
Ohh!

237
00:08:13,778 --> 00:08:16,174
好可爱哦
Oh. Isn't they a cutie?

238
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:19,720
没解决之前 不许出房门
Do not come out of this room until this is settled.

239
00:08:19,880 --> 00:08:22,280
我对公牛说的 我现在也对你们说 先生们
I will tell you what I tell the bulls, gentlemen --

240
00:08:22,660 --> 00:08:23,600
我爱你们俩
I love you both,

241
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:26,340
但别让我后悔没阉了你们
but don't make me regret letting you keep your testicles.

242
00:08:29,620 --> 00:08:30,960
好 出拳揍我吧
Okay. Punch me.

243
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:33,340
我知道听起来很疯狂 但我觉得...
I know it sounds crazy, but I think --

244
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:34,960
漂亮
Amazing!

245
00:08:35,024 --> 00:08:37,060
你居然真的动手
I can't believe you did that!

246
00:08:37,060 --> 00:08:39,400
我也没料到 但告诉你 这并没让我好受一些
Me neither. And it didn't make me feel better, by the way.

247
00:08:39,560 --> 00:08:41,440
要不试试踢他 或是戳他眼睛
Maybe kick him or jab him in the eye.

248
00:08:41,440 --> 00:08:42,760
曼尼 对不起
Manny, I'm sorry.

249
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:44,080
我也希望是别的女孩
I wish it were someone else,

250
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:45,940
但我真的很在乎雪莉
but I really do care about Sherry.

251
00:08:46,140 --> 00:08:47,720
我入睡前想着她
I go to sleep thinking about her.

252
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:49,340
醒来也想着她
I wake up thinking about her.

253
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:50,760
我一看到她 就好像
When I see her, it's like...

254
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:52,620
我的心也跟着笑了
my heart is smiling.

255
00:08:52,920 --> 00:08:55,580
我还以为这个家里的娘炮指数已经封顶了呢
Wow. I didn't think this house could get any gayer.

256
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:58,960
我也很在乎她 我希望她幸福
Well, I care about her, too, and I want her to be happy.

257
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:00,240
所以
So...

258
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:01,720
一定要告诉她你的感情
make sure she knows how you feel.

259
00:09:01,900 --> 00:09:03,480
她这种女孩需要听到那些
She's the kind of girl who needs to hear that.

260
00:09:04,300 --> 00:09:06,820
我不知道 我不擅长这种事
I don't know. I'm not good at that stuff.

261
00:09:06,980 --> 00:09:08,500
我还是装出高冷样子好了
I'm better off just playing it cool.

262
00:09:10,540 --> 00:09:11,600
不敢相信我会这么说
Can't believe I'm saying this...

263
00:09:12,100 --> 00:09:13,080
但我能帮你
but I can help.

264
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,500
我说 你打字
I'll talk, you type.

265
00:09:15,667 --> 00:09:18,060
你对我这么好 是想让我更内"久"吗
Are you being nice to make me feel worser?

266
00:09:18,060 --> 00:09:19,640
文盲 我说我打吧
Okay, I'll talk and type.

267
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:22,499
宝贝 你在这啊
Honey, there you are!

268
00:09:22,499 --> 00:09:23,960
我一直想跟你说...
I've been wanting to talk to you about something --

269
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:26,940
你打出的那记个人史上最精彩的高尔夫吗
About the greatest golf shot you ever made?

270
00:09:26,940 --> 00:09:28,640
-是哪一球来着 -老天
- What was that? - Oh, man.

271
00:09:28,660 --> 00:09:29,900
在里维埃拉的第十洞
10th hole at Riviera.

272
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:31,900
-我当时面临两个选择 -是吗
- I had a decision to make. - Yeah?

273
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:34,520
我可以选左边 避开障碍 或是...
I could go left and stay out of trouble or --

274
00:09:34,520 --> 00:09:36,140
做不到 是菲尔在叫我吗
Can't do it. Is Phil calling me?

275
00:09:36,140 --> 00:09:38,419
在你走之前 我有个工作机会
Listen, before you run, I have a professional opportunity

276
00:09:38,419 --> 00:09:39,778
-想让你考虑... -我也想听你说
- I'd like you to think -- - I-I'd love to hear it.

277
00:09:39,778 --> 00:09:41,780
但我觉得有点闷 我出去喘口气
J-- I'm just a little stuffy. Let me get some air.

278
00:09:41,780 --> 00:09:43,840
你知道吗
Are you aware that there are

279
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:46,260
全世界的狗加起来是意大利人口的15倍
15 times more dogs in the world than Italians?

280
00:09:46,600 --> 00:09:48,000
感觉有点冒犯人 不确定为什么
Feels offensive. Not sure why.

281
00:09:48,060 --> 00:09:48,740
我们是不是该跟其他人聊聊
Should we be mingling?

282
00:09:48,800 --> 00:09:50,640
听着 我不会长篇大论
Listen. I'm not gonna do a big spiel.

283
00:09:50,980 --> 00:09:53,481
只需告诉你 科学表明
Suffice to say that science has shown us

284
00:09:53,481 --> 00:09:57,260
有一只精力充沛的狗狗 比起上大学
that having a well-rested dog improves our earning potential

285
00:09:57,260 --> 00:09:58,799
更能提高我们的收入潜力
more than attending college.

286
00:09:58,799 --> 00:10:01,267
爸爸 现在能陪我玩卡车吗
Dad? Can we play with my trucks now?

287
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:03,300
再等我几分钟 好吗
Give me a couple of minutes, buddy, okay?

288
00:10:03,300 --> 00:10:06,679
因为我正在和斯黛拉狗床的新副总裁说话
'Cause I'm talking to the new VP of Dog Beds by Stella.

289
00:10:08,460 --> 00:10:08,840
克莱尔
Claire?

290
00:10:11,680 --> 00:10:12,120
克莱尔
Claire?

291
00:10:13,460 --> 00:10:15,080
你觉得小卡的父母真的
Do you really think that Cam's parents

292
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:16,680
给他买头等舱机票吗
bought him a first-class ticket?

293
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:17,500
他们不是很穷吗
Aren't they poor?

294
00:10:17,660 --> 00:10:19,320
他们吃的植物动物
Don't they, like, eat plants and animals

295
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:20,220
不都是院子里捡的吗
they find in their yard?

296
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:21,740
他们是农民 是的
They're farmers, yes.

297
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:23,300
我们得继续深挖
We gotta dig deeper.

298
00:10:23,400 --> 00:10:24,920
去拿小卡的手机 查他短信
Get Cam's phone. Check his texts.

299
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:26,660
那就侵犯他的隐私了
That's an invasion of his privacy.

300
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:28,099
再说 我都不知道他的密码
Plus, I don't even know his passcode.

301
00:10:28,099 --> 00:10:29,420
刷脸就能开机
Well, I just need his face.

302
00:10:29,420 --> 00:10:31,780
我总趁迪兰睡觉时查他手机
I break into Dylan's phone all the time while he's sleeping.

303
00:10:32,040 --> 00:10:33,040
查了也白查
Not that I need to.

304
00:10:33,100 --> 00:10:34,580
他只知道搜索水上乐园
All he does is Google water parks.

305
00:10:36,140 --> 00:10:37,020
小卡舅舅
Uncle Cam!

306
00:10:37,300 --> 00:10:39,620
我的手机落在车上了
I forgot my phone in my car,

307
00:10:39,620 --> 00:10:42,000
我想跟我最爱的舅舅在漂亮的圣诞晚餐前
and I want to take a Boomerang of me and my favorite uncle

308
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,320
一起录个表情包
at his gorgeous Christmas dinner.

309
00:10:43,420 --> 00:10:45,041
-我能用你的手机吗 -我很荣幸
- Can I use yours? - Well, that's very flattering,

310
00:10:45,041 --> 00:10:47,431
-但我正忙着 -5678
- but I'm a little busy with -- - 5, 6, 7, 8.

311
00:10:50,400 --> 00:10:52,380
肯定很多人转发 我去发到自己手机上
It's gonna be huge. I'm gonna text it to myself.

312
00:10:52,520 --> 00:10:53,480
好 谢谢
Okay, well, thank you.

313
00:10:53,660 --> 00:10:54,840
进去了 拿上酒
We're in. Bring the wine.

314
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:56,980
接下来查莉莉 我担心她在吸电子烟
Ooh, do Lily next. I'm worried she's vaping.

315
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:59,340
爸 你自己坐在这做什么
Dad? What are you doing over here by yourself?

316
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:00,116
你还好吗
Are you okay?

317
00:11:00,116 --> 00:11:03,020
我担心卢克和曼尼的矛盾
Oh, I'm-I'm worried this Luke and Manny thing

318
00:11:03,020 --> 00:11:04,600
会在工作上影响我和歌洛莉亚
will affect me and Gloria at work.

319
00:11:04,800 --> 00:11:06,460
我们一直相处得很愉快
We've been having such a great time.

320
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:08,600
我称呼我们为"美女与大佬"
I call us "Chica and the Man."

321
00:11:12,180 --> 00:11:14,120
爸 有件事我必须告诉你
Dad, I have to tell you something.

322
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:15,660
-告诉他什么 -你是何方神圣
- Tell him what? - How?!

323
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:18,380
大伙 看看是谁和好了
Hey, everybody, look who's friends again.

324
00:11:18,440 --> 00:11:19,240
没错
That's right.

325
00:11:19,340 --> 00:11:21,500
卢克会和雪莉交往 曼尼不介意了
Luke's gonna date Sherry, Manny's okay.

326
00:11:21,500 --> 00:11:23,700
矛盾解决 农场做派
Problem solved, farm-style!

327
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:26,416
不好意思
Sorry about that.

328
00:11:26,416 --> 00:11:28,260
在老家 每次有人喊"农场做派"
Back home, when someone would yell "farm-style,"

329
00:11:28,260 --> 00:11:28,920
我们就一起学牛叫
we'd all moo together.

330
00:11:29,020 --> 00:11:29,900
这是良好教养[养殖]的体现
It's a sign of good breeding.

331
00:11:30,220 --> 00:11:32,880
总之 快来 坐好 都坐好
Anyway, come. Sit, sit. Let's go. Sit down.

332
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:35,920
你还好意思自称哥伦比亚人吗
How do you call yourself Colombian

333
00:11:35,920 --> 00:11:39,080
这么轻易就放过那臭小子
after letting that skunk off the hook so easily?

334
00:11:39,340 --> 00:11:41,760
你最好已经割下他一根脚趾揣兜里了
Tell me, at least, that you have one of his toes in your pocket.

335
00:11:42,020 --> 00:11:44,500
别这样 歌洛莉亚 这是好消息
Come on, now, Gloria. This is good news.

336
00:11:45,220 --> 00:11:46,740
背叛还能被夸是好事吗
Disloyalty being rewarded?

337
00:11:47,620 --> 00:11:48,800
背叛 你真好意思说
Disloyalty? Really?

338
00:11:49,160 --> 00:11:50,140
爸 我撞见歌洛莉亚
Dad, I caught Gloria

339
00:11:50,140 --> 00:11:51,940
找其他房地产经纪人面试工作
interviewing for a job with another Realtor.

340
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:52,680
什么
What?!

341
00:11:53,520 --> 00:11:55,460
美女 你怎么能这样
Chica! How could you?

342
00:11:56,180 --> 00:11:57,080
她回来了
There she is.

343
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:59,918
为了躲我从窗户跳出去的女人
The woman that threw herself out the window to avoid me.

344
00:11:59,918 --> 00:12:02,260
爸 别傻了 我是摔出去了
No, Dad. Don't be silly. I-I fell.

345
00:12:02,260 --> 00:12:03,600
不不不 亲爱的 我明白
No, no, no, honey. I get it.

346
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:04,820
你不想来为我工作
You don't want to come and work for me,

347
00:12:04,820 --> 00:12:05,940
我想我知道为什么
and I think I know why.

348
00:12:06,280 --> 00:12:07,360
爸 我很抱歉
Dad, I'm sorry.

349
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:09,430
不必 你是不想再次让我失望
No, you don't want to let me down again,

350
00:12:09,430 --> 00:12:13,100
像伊瑟拉视界那个大失误一样
like with that whole... Ezravision fiasco.

351
00:12:13,100 --> 00:12:13,580
什么
What?

352
00:12:14,740 --> 00:12:16,880
不顾别人感受的白人老头
Oh, insensitive old white men.

353
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:18,480
少了这么一个人圣诞节都不完整了
What would Christmas be without one?

354
00:12:18,520 --> 00:12:20,800
各种肤色的人都会不顾别人感受
We seem to have insensitive people of all ethnicities!

355
00:12:21,580 --> 00:12:23,740
你是在影射我吗 我今天很乖
Was that a shot at me? I've been good.

356
00:12:23,940 --> 00:12:26,020
我忍住没说的话说出来你都不信
You can't believe the stuff I haven't said today.

357
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:28,100
小卡 你自己回家是怎么回事
Cam, what's up with your trip home?

358
00:12:28,140 --> 00:12:29,220
你父母根本不在老家
Your parents aren't even there.

359
00:12:29,500 --> 00:12:31,720
"圣诞快乐 不是节日快乐
"Merry Christmas. Not Happy Holidays.

360
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:32,560
来自加尔维斯顿的祝福"
From Galveston."

361
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:34,880
你怎么查起我的手机了
Okay, how are you snooping through my phone?!

362
00:12:35,420 --> 00:12:35,900
是你
You!

363
00:12:36,280 --> 00:12:37,539
你说录表情包是骗我的
That was a false Boomerang?

364
00:12:37,539 --> 00:12:39,700
你猜怎么着 算了 我原谅你们
Well -- You know what? Forget it. Forgiven.

365
00:12:39,700 --> 00:12:42,260
我只希望今天能是一个特别的圣诞节
I just want today to be a special Christmas.

366
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:43,960
现在请各位就坐
Now, please, everyone sit down.

367
00:12:44,020 --> 00:12:46,600
我们手拉手祈祷 好好美餐一顿
We'll grab hands, say grace, have a lovely meal.

368
00:12:46,800 --> 00:12:49,740
好了 拉起你们左右两边的手
Okay. Grab the person to your left and right.

369
00:12:50,960 --> 00:12:51,380
亲爱的主
Dear Lord --

370
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:53,660
我就知道你还因为伊瑟拉视界生气
I knew you were still pissed about that Ezravision thing.

371
00:12:53,880 --> 00:12:54,820
克莱尔 我们在祈祷
Claire, we are praying.

372
00:12:55,760 --> 00:12:56,860
感谢您赐予我们食物
Thank you for this food --

373
00:12:57,140 --> 00:12:59,880
那可是你签字同意的 老伙计
You signed off on that whole deal, buddy!

374
00:12:59,940 --> 00:13:02,280
我才不是因为怕让你失望
And I am not afraid of disappointing you.

375
00:13:02,340 --> 00:13:05,160
感谢您让我们的家人不计较小仇小怨
and for our family as we rise above petty grievances --

376
00:13:05,340 --> 00:13:08,100
是因为新奇狗狗床太蠢了
It's because novelty dog beds are stupid.

377
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:10,238
狗狗们才不在意它们的床是不是菠萝
Dogs don't care if they're sleeping in a pineapple!

378
00:13:10,238 --> 00:13:12,960
凤梨床在狗众点评网上有四吠好评
The Pina Colassie got four woofs on Whelp!

379
00:13:12,960 --> 00:13:14,460
这话让你听起来像个
That just makes you sound like some --

380
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:16,000
请求主 让我们不要称呼彼此为
Please, Lord, help us not use terms

381
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:18,400
"低能"或"傻老头"
like "imbecile" or "senile old man."

382
00:13:18,560 --> 00:13:20,940
我帮你重返职场 你就这样谢我
This is the thanks I get for getting you back into the workplace?

383
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:22,060
说得好 杰
Nice line, Jay.

384
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:23,820
这句话原封不动还给你妻子
I could say the same thing to your wife.

385
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:26,180
真不敢相信你告我的密
I can't believe that you ratted me out.

386
00:13:26,220 --> 00:13:27,220
我才不怕你
I'm not afraid of you!

387
00:13:27,220 --> 00:13:28,400
有这么多人在我就不怕
With... everyone else around.

388
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:29,720
好了 够了
Okay. That's enough.

389
00:13:30,060 --> 00:13:31,960
真不敢相信你们所有人连一顿饭的工夫
I can't believe you all couldn't hold it together

390
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:34,240
都必须要吵起来
for one meal and not argue!

391
00:13:34,500 --> 00:13:36,800
小卡 我们每次过节都是这样的
Cam, this is what we always do on the holidays.

392
00:13:36,880 --> 00:13:37,840
有什么大不了的
What's the big deal?

393
00:13:38,160 --> 00:13:39,380
大不了的是
The big deal is that...

394
00:13:39,380 --> 00:13:41,060
这可能是我们最后一次一起过圣诞了
this could be our last Christmas together.

395
00:13:41,400 --> 00:13:42,722
-什么 -最后的圣诞
- What? - Last Christmas?

396
00:13:42,722 --> 00:13:43,680
-少夸张了 -你是什么意思
- Stop being so dramatic. - What do you mean?

397
00:13:43,680 --> 00:13:45,120
我的天 你要死了吗
Oh, my God. You're dying?

398
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:47,120
不 我不是要死了 是其他的理由
No, I'm not dying. It's something else.

399
00:13:53,240 --> 00:13:55,080
他是故意暂停增加戏剧性吗
Is he pausing to be dramatic?

400
00:13:55,740 --> 00:13:56,820
你新来的吗
What do you think?

401
00:14:04,581 --> 00:14:06,826
-你能不能... -都是从秋天开始的
- Will you j- - It all started last fall.

402
00:14:06,860 --> 00:14:09,160
有个球探来看了我的一场比赛 对我很满意
A scout came to one of my games and liked what he saw,

403
00:14:09,160 --> 00:14:12,740
现在密苏里中北部大学在选总教练
and now I'm one of two finalists for the head coaching position

404
00:14:12,740 --> 00:14:15,240
我是两个最终候选人之一
at the University of North Central Missouri.

405
00:14:15,313 --> 00:14:17,002
-什么 -你是什么意思
- What? - What do you mean?

406
00:14:17,406 --> 00:14:18,744
那可是大事
Hey, that's a big deal.

407
00:14:18,744 --> 00:14:20,340
是的 他们让我飞过去
Yeah, they're flying me out to, uh,

408
00:14:20,340 --> 00:14:22,880
见见体育部主任 假如一切顺利
meet the athletic director, and if all goes well...

409
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:24,900
开春我就能上任了
I could start this spring.

410
00:14:25,638 --> 00:14:27,125
你为什么没跟我直说
W-Why didn't you just tell me?

411
00:14:27,125 --> 00:14:28,613
因为我不想给你压力
'Cause I-I didn't want to stress you out

412
00:14:28,613 --> 00:14:30,449
想等定了再说
until it was-it was real.

413
00:14:30,702 --> 00:14:32,337
等等
So...wait.

414
00:14:32,337 --> 00:14:33,920
你们真的要搬走吗
W-Would you guys really move?

415
00:14:33,920 --> 00:14:35,140
米奇尔才不会搬去密苏里
Mitchell's not moving to Missouri.

416
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:37,660
他能做什么工作 起诉小镇酒鬼奥蒂斯吗
What would he do for work? Prosecute Otis, the town drunk?

417
00:14:37,720 --> 00:14:39,103
不好意思 我们不是小县城
Excuse me. It's not Mayberry.

418
00:14:39,103 --> 00:14:40,789
而且告诉你 我们镇上的害群之马
And I'll have you know, our town ne'er-do-well

419
00:14:40,789 --> 00:14:43,771
是吸处方鼻喷上瘾的女性
is a female who's addicted to prescription nasal spray, so...

420
00:14:43,771 --> 00:14:45,938
我还要补充
Okay, and-and-and just for the record, I...

421
00:14:46,320 --> 00:14:48,540
我会去的
I would go.

422
00:14:48,900 --> 00:14:51,540
这样才公平 小卡在这里住了这么久
I mean, it's only fair. Cam's been here forever.

423
00:14:52,340 --> 00:14:53,280
我不喜欢这样
I don't like this.

424
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:54,960
我知道 大伙
I know, you guys.

425
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:57,240
但这对他来说是个大机会
But this is an incredible opportunity for him.

426
00:14:57,240 --> 00:14:58,280
我怎么能不同意
How could I say no?

427
00:14:58,360 --> 00:14:59,740
你们不能走
You guys can't go!

428
00:14:59,740 --> 00:15:02,020
我不希望宝宝的生活里没有你们
I don't want my babies growing up without you.

429
00:15:02,020 --> 00:15:04,020
他们永远不会相信我的那些故事
They're never gonna believe my stories!

430
00:15:04,020 --> 00:15:06,240
瞧 所以我才保密
See, this is why I kept it a secret.

431
00:15:06,620 --> 00:15:08,699
我还在这里担心你们毁掉圣诞节
Here I was, worried about you all ruining Christmas,

432
00:15:08,699 --> 00:15:11,240
结果现在被我毁了
and...now I've done it.

433
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:12,180
大家 我很抱歉
I'm sorry, everyone.

434
00:15:12,480 --> 00:15:13,980
你完全不必抱歉
You have no reason to be sorry.

435
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:15,960
我很抱歉 我拆散家庭
Yes, I do. I break up families.

436
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:16,820
像伊丽莎白·泰勒一样
I'm Liz Taylor.

437
00:15:16,980 --> 00:15:18,100
你为什么总是自比女人
Why is it never a man?

438
00:15:18,420 --> 00:15:19,920
既然聊到这了 小卡舅舅
For what it's worth, Uncle Cam,

439
00:15:20,020 --> 00:15:21,560
我的公司在纽约有分部
my company has an office in New York,

440
00:15:21,560 --> 00:15:23,200
我说了我愿意被指派过去
and I said I'd be open to transferring,

441
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:25,117
说不定我才是拆散家庭的罪人
so I could easily break up the family.

442
00:15:25,117 --> 00:15:27,320
你... 你从没跟我们提过啊
You -- You never mentioned this to us.

443
00:15:27,320 --> 00:15:29,380
对了 我也跟我公司诺普说
Yeah, and I told NERP that I would be

444
00:15:29,380 --> 00:15:31,200
我愿意去巴黎分公司工作
open to working at the Paris office.

445
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:33,220
迪兰跟我也一直很想去那里住
I mean, Dylan and I have always wanted to live there.

446
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:33,856
等等
Wait.

447
00:15:33,856 --> 00:15:36,004
你要把双胞胎带去法国吗
Y-You'd take the babies to France?

448
00:15:36,222 --> 00:15:38,680
我们... 我们其实有考虑过这想法
We -- We -- We've talked about it.

449
00:15:38,680 --> 00:15:40,960
抱歉 你们一看着我时我就紧张
Sorry. I get nervous when you're all looking at me.

450
00:15:42,553 --> 00:15:43,680
我也申请了
A-And I applied

451
00:15:43,680 --> 00:15:45,800
伦敦的名校皇家戏剧艺术学院
to the Royal Academy of Dramatic Arts in London.

452
00:15:45,920 --> 00:15:46,820
我也有可能会去那里啊
I could end up there.

453
00:15:47,040 --> 00:15:48,120
对对对 这超"有可能"
Yeah, that's a real possibility.

454
00:15:48,860 --> 00:15:50,200
如果大家都要各奔东西
Listen, if everyone's taking off,

455
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:51,980
或许我们也可以去棕榈泉买那套房子
maybe we buy that house in Palm Springs,

456
00:15:52,040 --> 00:15:53,140
多多在那里享受人生
spend a little more time there.

457
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:55,340
意思是明年圣诞节有可能就剩下
And that means next Christmas would be

458
00:15:55,340 --> 00:15:58,060
我与菲尔还有一些可怜的小火腿[猪]吗
me and Phil and some sad little ham?

459
00:15:58,200 --> 00:16:00,380
乔不会跟着外公外婆走吗
Oh, wouldn't Joe go with Grandpa and Gloria?

460
00:16:01,720 --> 00:16:03,960
抱歉 亲爱的 我只是又醉又伤感罢了
Sorry, sweetie. I'm just drunk and upset.

461
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:05,800
气氛一下就哀伤了起来
This got sad.

462
00:16:06,051 --> 00:16:08,119
好歹现在还没有人要离开嘛
Right. Well, no -- no one's leaving now.

463
00:16:08,119 --> 00:16:10,720
-在还有机会时珍惜并享受彼此的陪伴吧 -对啊
- You know, so let's just enjoy each other while we still can. - Yes!

464
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:13,154
-对吧 -没错 来帮忙我把沙拉弄好 米奇
- Right? - Yes. Help me with the salads, Mitch.

465
00:16:13,154 --> 00:16:13,380
-好的 没问题 -来吧
- Yes. Okay. - Yes.

466
00:16:13,380 --> 00:16:15,000
我们速速就回
We'll be right back.

467
00:16:21,800 --> 00:16:22,340
菲尔
Phil...

468
00:16:23,620 --> 00:16:26,440
我去那个面试是因为我爱你
I took that interview because I love you,

469
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:28,720
我不想毁了我们之间的关系
and I don't want to screw up our relationship.

470
00:16:29,220 --> 00:16:31,740
我不想我们最后变成克莱尔与杰
I don't want to end up like Claire and Jay.

471
00:16:32,320 --> 00:16:34,520
你想太多了 我们相处得可开心了
Please. You and I have been doing great.

472
00:16:34,700 --> 00:16:35,940
那是因为我有所保留
Because I hold back.

473
00:16:36,120 --> 00:16:37,340
我其实很有主见
I have strong opinions

474
00:16:37,340 --> 00:16:40,220
但我一直没说出来 因为不想跟你有冲突
that I don't tell you because I want to get along.

475
00:16:40,480 --> 00:16:41,240
什么想法啊
Like what?

476
00:16:41,700 --> 00:16:43,020
有什么想法都可以跟我说啊
You can tell me anything.

477
00:16:43,260 --> 00:16:45,200
比如公交站长椅的广告牌
Like that bus bench sign.

478
00:16:45,500 --> 00:16:46,740
我觉得太傻里傻气了
I think it's goofy.

479
00:16:47,320 --> 00:16:51,140
我们的视力都很好 为什么要戴眼镜啊
If we have 20/20 vision, why are we wearing glasses?

480
00:16:51,760 --> 00:16:52,820
我明白了
I get it.

481
00:16:52,880 --> 00:16:54,460
我只是想要在我国现在这纷纷扰扰之际
I just wanted to bring a little joy to our country

482
00:16:54,460 --> 00:16:56,100
为人民注入一点欢乐气氛 但你不是我国人
in this tumultuous time, but you're not from here,

483
00:16:56,100 --> 00:16:57,400
所以对你来说这点根本无所谓
so maybe it doesn't matter as much to you.

484
00:16:57,500 --> 00:16:58,100
你看你这样子
You see?

485
00:16:59,120 --> 00:16:59,580
我明白了
Yes.

486
00:17:00,320 --> 00:17:01,960
懂了 我很玻璃心
Yes. I'm sensitive.

487
00:17:02,653 --> 00:17:04,659
但我还是需要啊
But I-I need this.

488
00:17:05,060 --> 00:17:08,400
需要一个人可以提出意见来跟我进行智慧的碰撞
New ideas, someone -- someone to push up against me.

489
00:17:08,420 --> 00:17:10,080
说实话 你是这世上
And honestly, I can't think of anyone

490
00:17:10,080 --> 00:17:12,479
我最能接受来跟我碰撞的人了
I'd rather have pushing up against me than you.

491
00:17:12,479 --> 00:17:14,263
菲尔 我忍好多年了
Ay, Phil, it's been years.

492
00:17:14,263 --> 00:17:17,100
我不能再假装没听到你词里的歧义了
I can't pretend I don't hear those anymore.

493
00:17:17,100 --> 00:17:17,640
听到什么
Hear what?

494
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:21,120
是啦 你说得对
Yeah. You're right.

495
00:17:21,306 --> 00:17:25,128
伊瑟拉视界的事是我自己签的字
I did sign off on that whole... Ezravision thing.

496
00:17:25,128 --> 00:17:26,444
不是你的错
Mm-hmm. It's not your fault.

497
00:17:27,200 --> 00:17:28,520
其实我...
Well, I, uh...

498
00:17:28,520 --> 00:17:31,480
我会有点犟嘴或许是我觉得自己也有责任
I might be a little defensive because I feel responsible.

499
00:17:33,080 --> 00:17:35,620
而狗床的生意... 并不蠢啦
And dog beds aren't -- they're not stupid.

500
00:17:35,740 --> 00:17:38,057
狗狗开心主人就开心嘛 对吧
People are happy when their dogs are happy, right?

501
00:17:38,057 --> 00:17:40,180
我的确是在拯救世界啦
Well, I'm definitely saving lives,

502
00:17:40,180 --> 00:17:43,300
但这生意也是没有一飞冲天[离开橱柜界]
but, I mean, they're not... exactly flying off the shelf.

503
00:17:43,300 --> 00:17:45,628
你是想拖我跟你一起下水吗
You were trying to bring me aboard a sinking ship?

504
00:17:45,628 --> 00:17:47,895
我是想要邀请你来跟我一起拯救它
Well, I was bringing you aboard to -- to save it,

505
00:17:47,895 --> 00:17:49,656
就算你都救不起也没关系 我...
or even if you couldn't, I-I...

506
00:17:51,053 --> 00:17:52,956
我只是很想念跟你一起打拼啦
I just miss working together.

507
00:17:53,300 --> 00:17:56,140
给我一种重新当个好爸爸的机会
I feel it gave me a second chance with you.

508
00:17:57,780 --> 00:17:59,400
有的 真的有 老爸
It did. It did, Dad.

509
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:00,940
我心里对你无冤无仇了
And we're good now.

510
00:18:01,720 --> 00:18:04,160
所以是时候我该离巢去展翅高飞
So, it's time for me to go and prove myself on my own.

511
00:18:05,172 --> 00:18:06,310
你看看
Look at this.

512
00:18:06,736 --> 00:18:08,843
对我来说 10秒钟前 你也才那么大
10 seconds ago, that was you.

513
00:18:09,500 --> 00:18:11,578
我得确保我跟他不需要第二次机会来修复
I gotta make sure he and I don't need a second chance.

514
00:18:11,578 --> 00:18:13,200
小心啦
Yeah. Well, watch out.

515
00:18:13,200 --> 00:18:14,600
感觉很快他就得去当你的员工了
Pretty soon, he's gonna be working for you.

516
00:18:14,780 --> 00:18:16,300
我不知道他有没有来商界闯荡的头脑
You know, I don't know if he has the head for it.

517
00:18:16,380 --> 00:18:18,960
之前他跟我提了一个猫形状狗床的点子
He pitched a dog bed the other day in the shape of a cat.

518
00:18:19,420 --> 00:18:21,340
谁会想要睡在敌人体内啊
I mean, who wants to sleep in your enemy?

519
00:18:21,340 --> 00:18:24,337
简直像我睡在乔恩·沃伊特体内
It would be like me napping in Jon Voight.

520
00:18:24,337 --> 00:18:26,177
-我跟你说过那个故事吧 -说过了
- I told you that story... - Yeah. Yeah.

521
00:18:26,800 --> 00:18:29,009
看到了吗 你得到你想要的圣诞节
Look at that. You got what you wanted for Christmas.

522
00:18:29,009 --> 00:18:31,660
是的 而且你看 每个人都坐在
Yes, and can I just say, everyone is exactly

523
00:18:31,660 --> 00:18:33,140
我最早安排他们坐的座位上
where I put them in the first place?

524
00:18:37,320 --> 00:18:40,620
过各种节日时 是哪一点令我们情绪脆弱呢
What is it about the holidays that makes us so emotional?

525
00:18:42,600 --> 00:18:44,840
是因为看着孩子们都在长大吗
Is it watching our kids grow up?

526
00:18:45,325 --> 00:18:46,279
谁会赢呢
Who's gonna get it?

527
00:18:49,060 --> 00:18:51,820
还是因为我们能冰释前嫌
Is it how we put our disagreements aside?

528
00:18:51,820 --> 00:18:55,740
等等 如果我们扮演雪儿与桑尼夫妇
What if instead, I am Cher, you are Sonny,

529
00:18:55,740 --> 00:18:58,230
并说出他们乐团的经典歌词"我有[罩]你宝贝"
and it says "We've got you, babe"?

530
00:18:58,260 --> 00:19:01,680
歌洛莉亚 我不知道怎么说了
Gloria, I-I don't know how to say this, but that is

531
00:19:01,680 --> 00:19:05,700
但这真是我听过最他妈新鲜的点子了
the freshest damn idea I have ever heard!

532
00:19:05,700 --> 00:19:06,800
我爱死啦
I love it!

533
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:10,220
还是因为跟你一生都离不开的人待在一起
Is it just being with people you can't imagine life without?

534
00:19:10,800 --> 00:19:11,680
亲爱的你看
Oh, look, sweetie.

535
00:19:11,700 --> 00:19:14,357
上面写这个密苏里州城市有鲜活的艺术文化
It says that this Missouri town has a lively art scene.

536
00:19:14,357 --> 00:19:16,540
是"方舟文化"
It says "Ark scene."

537
00:19:16,800 --> 00:19:19,600
他们在为下一次神降大洪水做准备
They're preparing for the Lord's next flood?

538
00:19:20,960 --> 00:19:21,360
"有意思"
Fun.

539
00:19:21,920 --> 00:19:23,320
还是...
Or is it --

540
00:19:23,320 --> 00:19:25,300
别闹了 我们能不能好好把照拍完
Enough! Can we just take this picture already?

541
00:19:25,960 --> 00:19:29,220
人家只是想多多珍惜大家齐聚一堂的时光
Excuse me for wanting to cherish you all as long as I can.

542
00:19:29,300 --> 00:19:30,920
工作那边都还没说要你
You don't even have the job yet.

543
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:34,040
好了 定时拍摄已就绪 15秒倒数
Alright, the timer's set, everyone. We have 15 seconds!

544
00:19:34,040 --> 00:19:35,120
来吧来吧 大家快各就各位
Let's go, everybody. Hurry up.

545
00:19:35,520 --> 00:19:36,200
天啊
Oh, my God.

546
00:19:36,820 --> 00:19:37,940
雪莉跟我分手了
Sherry broke up with me.

547
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:39,720
在我发给她所有
After I texted her all

548
00:19:39,720 --> 00:19:41,180
你教我的那些好听话之后就说分手了
those nice things you told me to say to her.

549
00:19:41,280 --> 00:19:42,780
对哦 我忘了
Oh, yeah, that's right!

550
00:19:42,940 --> 00:19:44,977
她很讨厌男生发展太快
She hates it when guys move too fast.

551
00:19:44,977 --> 00:19:47,040
爱过但失去 总比爱的资格都没有要强
Oh, well. Better to have loved and lost.

552
00:19:47,040 --> 00:19:48,900
真是我的哥伦比亚乖儿子
There's my Colombian boy!

553
00:19:54,540 --> 00:19:56,200
我回来啦
Hey! I'm back!

554
00:19:56,480 --> 00:19:56,960
你回来啦
Hi!

555
00:19:57,480 --> 00:19:59,540
所以工作单位那边有消息了吗
So, have you heard anything about the job yet?

556
00:19:59,600 --> 00:20:00,740
没 还没呢
No. No, not yet.

557
00:20:00,740 --> 00:20:02,420
而且可能接下来几个月都得等 但...
And I may not for a couple months, but...

558
00:20:02,420 --> 00:20:05,220
我已经尽人事 剩下只能
it's out of my control, and I'm just --

559
00:20:05,220 --> 00:20:05,680
听天命了
I'm letting go.

560
00:20:06,060 --> 00:20:07,038
我要疯啦
This is killing me!

561
00:20:07,038 --> 00:20:09,080
我的未来命悬一线
My whole future hangs in the balance,

562
00:20:09,080 --> 00:20:10,380
而这些人... 他们根本不当回事
and these people... they don't care.

563
00:20:10,560 --> 00:20:11,260
他们根本不在乎
They don't care!

564
00:20:11,720 --> 00:20:13,040
我现在好多了
I'm better now.

565
00:20:13,190 --> 00:20:15,080
既来之则安之
Whatever happens, happends.

566
00:20:15,080 --> 00:20:15,902
快他妈的把我手机还我
Give me my damn phone.

567
00:20:15,902 --> 00:20:17,060
我要打给这些虐待狂
I'm gonna call the sadists,

568
00:20:17,060 --> 00:20:18,260
我要问他们
and I'm gonna ask him,

569
00:20:18,260 --> 00:20:19,420
他们为什么恨我要我死
why they hate me?

570
00:20:19,780 --> 00:20:21,200
管他们的呢
You know what? Screw them.

571
00:20:21,280 --> 00:20:23,320
我喜欢我们的现状
I love what we have.

572
00:20:25,920 --> 00:20:27,340
老天爷对我真好
I'm so blessed.

573
00:20:28,140 --> 00:20:29,920
感觉无论我再怎么努力
It's like no matter what I do,

574
00:20:29,920 --> 00:20:31,940
我永远都只能有个"一半人生"
I'm always gonna have a B+ life.

575
00:20:32,260 --> 00:20:33,200
永远不能圆圆满满
Never an A.

576
00:20:33,920 --> 00:20:35,660
1秒 祝你也新年快乐
And.... Happy new year to you too!
